 "1167270421589414", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393425_1167270424922747_1907140739452079368_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=txtFNiG8c_kQ7kNvwG99k7V&_nc_oc=AdkTTd9-fAN0Tmvw52KD6IAP-QDV-oFp_NzSQDsqfbWEq3U366iEosO4cGkwvozuE68&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzKDg7n2b_3BREoD1jQPTlAwcmMO_q237t0PzleoRgjPg&oe=69BA87B9"}, {"file_name": "screenshot03.png", "id": "1320236425766559", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392005_1320236429099892_7026969068655260219_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_ZxmxJdq_OAQ7kNvwEg3Uaz&_nc_oc=Adm_iaCJfuOj_n4d0wKNls1TYpWC55RgvbE208nKnzArxoy3GOUy5QoC7u5ONOR8oxk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyryJLaKQ9j_2OeELche0tgTBc7Fq2Z7xI7FhYGsLdR_A&oe=69BA9753"}, {"file_name": "screenshot04.png", "id": "1408931723813604", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391949_1408931727146937_1574658016866773147_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EJnL1qRLQhIQ7kNvwECLeCy&_nc_oc=AdmOxrCQy7pQLPT79MXYIfOT7wr4CiJef2JFpVyvYk1VS0RobW6T1Nse5QHQknwhceE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afzpc_fLx3F15_tA7_AzMcfrvfF7WX-eE1CAKLPnlUmkXQ&oe=69BAA2FB"}, {"file_name": "screenshot05.png", "id": "418176134719567", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391998_418176138052900_6204508764481913331_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eiISM47EALUQ7kNvwEHhXOB&_nc_oc=AdkmVoN-5nreZdru-KYA2tP2nPclaaEgIysXM8abQ-5Nc2cWHznFBtvMrIUMztCxxS8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afxck29I8lwHgxa2Dv9Vqg_fSYGGgZC0TkyxghqQLQyTJA&oe=69BAA44A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "thumbnail2.png", "id": "1152565683077389", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391896_1152565689744055_250834400001166292_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MNxlrWRAZFIQ7kNvwEIvJtd&_nc_oc=AdlIRyRsjmwORsvhKckhDEjEVoIwKLmWLrIuX6_5wvYbvTRaPPMDyV2k8PwdkObGVrI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwSZJ7WgBPQZvFPuJGX_3P9CjPG52Q8guu2oyJNMIbWuA&oe=69BA8D7E"}, "display_name": "Aerodrums 2", "keywords": [], "long_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking.\n\nAerodrums 2 is an expressive and versatile air drumming instrument. It is a standalone device that uses high-speed optical motion capture technology to accurately track the position of your drumsticks and feet in 3D. Unlike acoustic and traditional electronic drum sets, Aerodrums 2 is lightweight and portable, it is silent when used with headphones, and it takes up no space when not in use.\n\nPaired with Meta Quest headsets, Aerodrums 2 offers an unparalleled drumming experience. Passthrough mode and depth occlusion let you see your real hands and drumsticks while drumming, while hand-tracking is used to further improve stick-tracking accuracy.\n\nTo learn more about Aerodrums 2 visit aerodrums.com", "short_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking."}]}, "developer_name": "Aerodrums", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://aerodrums.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Aerodrums", "supp